Minnehaha County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/minnehaha-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 33% of normal in January to February and 48% in September to October, while June to July hit 127% that year. So far in 2026 the middle shows 14% in January to February and 35% in February to March. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 28334 at 45% that year.</p>"}
